1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:04,401
Rae! This milk is good till
the end of the universe!

2
00:00:04,441 --> 00:00:07,292
That's tonight!
Milk is half off!

3
00:00:07,332 --> 00:00:09,409
Tonight?!

4
00:00:09,449 --> 00:00:11,625
The stars are
going out!

5
00:00:12,095 --> 00:00:14,584
Then it's still good
till midnight.

6
00:00:16,254 --> 00:00:19,213
Milk is now
ninety-nine percent off!

7
00:00:19,433 --> 00:00:22,144
Rae? Are we dead?

8
00:00:22,184 --> 00:00:24,438
Milk's still good.
